# Working documents: kept on the machine that produced them, never shipped. The decision log explains
# why the code looks like it does, `analysis/` holds the review reports, and `.ralph/` is the loop
# state. A public document must never link into any of them.
docs/decisions/
analysis/
.ralph/

# Claude Code agent worktrees live here while agents build in parallel; never tracked
.claude/worktrees/
